{
    "title": "Flirtual - VR Dating App",
    "description": "Make an avatar profile, match and message other users, then go on safe, magical dates in Virtual Reality!\r\n\r\n> Avatar profiles\r\nVR lets you express yourself fully. Meeting other people through avatars is fun, safe, and low-stress.\r\n\r\n> Personality-first\r\nVR dates let your personality shine. Get to know someone before face-revealing or going on a video call.\r\n\r\n> Match through interests and identities\r\nSelect from dozens of profile tags, or add your own custom tags! Our matchmaking system is extremely customizable and helps you find compatible matches.\r\n\r\n> Meet in VR\r\nAfter you match on Flirtual, you can meet up in any VR app or game. This includes: VRChat, Horizon Worlds, Zenith, and more.\r\n\r\nYou can also exchange Discord and VR usernames on Flirtual.\r\n\r\nGET STARTED\r\nSet up your profile in 3 steps:\r\n1. Upload pictures of your VR avatar from SteamVR, VRChat, or your Oculus/Meta account.\r\n2. Write a short bio (or use our bio prompts).\r\n3. List your favorite VR games, do a personality quiz, and share your favorite interests.\r\n\r\nSAFETY\r\nYou must be 18 or older to use Flirtual. Safety is our priority. VR lets you go on dates without risking your physical safety. Flirtual has an active moderation team and a user report system. We have zero tolerance for underage profiles, NSFW content, or discrimination. You can read more about your privacy and data rights on Flirtual at flirtu.al/privacy and flirtu.al/terms\r\n\r\nX: x.com/getflirtual\r\nOur Discord community: discord.gg/flirtual",
    "descriptionHTML": "Make an avatar profile, match and message other users, then go on safe, magical dates in Virtual Reality!<br><br>&gt; Avatar profiles<br>VR lets you express yourself fully. Meeting other people through avatars is fun, safe, and low-stress.<br><br>&gt; Personality-first<br>VR dates let your personality shine. Get to know someone before face-revealing or going on a video call.<br><br>&gt; Match through interests and identities<br>Select from dozens of profile tags, or add your own custom tags! Our matchmaking system is extremely customizable and helps you find compatible matches.<br><br>&gt; Meet in VR<br>After you match on Flirtual, you can meet up in any VR app or game. This includes: VRChat, Horizon Worlds, Zenith, and more.<br><br>You can also exchange Discord and VR usernames on Flirtual.<br><br>GET STARTED<br>Set up your profile in 3 steps:<br>1. Upload pictures of your VR avatar from SteamVR, VRChat, or your Oculus/Meta account.<br>2. Write a short bio (or use our bio prompts).<br>3. List your favorite VR games, do a personality quiz, and share your favorite interests.<br><br>SAFETY<br>You must be 18 or older to use Flirtual. Safety is our priority. VR lets you go on dates without risking your physical safety. Flirtual has an active moderation team and a user report system. We have zero tolerance for underage profiles, NSFW content, or discrimination. You can read more about your privacy and data rights on Flirtual at flirtu.al/privacy and flirtu.al/terms<br><br>X: x.com/getflirtual<br>Our Discord community: discord.gg/flirtual",
